            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To raise the product of two numbers to the power of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2,]</span> we can raise each number to the power of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2,]</span> and then multiply:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (3\\times 2)^2=3^2\\times 2^2]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To raise the product of two numbers to the power of [MATH: 2,] we can raise each number to the power of [MATH: 2,] and then multiply:\n\n[MATH: (3\\times 2)^2=3^2\\times 2^2]",
            "images": [],
